{"id":"wb-4-175","name":"开封城墙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"开封城墙","text":"开封城墙，位于中华人民共和国河南省开封市龙亭区，为清代开封府城的城墙。1996年被列为第四批全国重点文物保护单位。全长14.4公里，仅次于南京城墙。比西安城墙遗留长度略长，但保存完整性不及西安城墙。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BC%80%E5%B0%81%E5%9F%8E%E5%A2%99","revisionId":94177196,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94177196","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/0792b711793237b2f05bc63a.jpg","title":"20140419_Kaifeng_City_Wall.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20140419_Kaifeng_City_Wall.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b6/20140419_Kaifeng_City_Wall.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"The west side of Kaifeng City Wall","width":320,"height":213}}